    "text": "Open source models are crazy.\n\nAlibaba just dropped Wan 2.2 Animate, a new model that can animate any character based on a simple souce image.\n\nIt handles facial expressions and body movements like no other model.\n\n10 insane examples: (sound on) https://t.co/ztLwlWDfZb\n\n1. Expressive Human Animation https://t.co/1OpPn8FCPx\n\n2. Expressive Human Animation https://t.co/6rdxSOwWxv\n\n3. Generalizable Arbitrary Character Animation https://t.co/5iy4gPaLAV\n\n4. Generalizable Arbitrary Character Animation https://t.co/PXkk4M8x24\n\n5. Dynamic Motion and Camera https://t.co/KEsZ7ngowJ\n\n6. Dynamic Motion and Camera https://t.co/h6XwdV6YtC\n\n7. Character Replacement with Seamless Environmental Integration https://t.co/kD6lQNOmqQ\n\n8. Character Replacement with Seamless Environmental Integration https://t.co/DoJJHsi2y0\n\n9. Consistent Lighting and Color Tone Replication https://t.co/NXGukr9ThB\n\n10. Qualitative Comparisons https://t.co/gCJEjypHmF\n\nProject page: https://t.co/56oUI8nFoJ\nPaper: https://t.co/D5vlqeqGjP",
